    delphi:hasConfidence "0.75"^^xsd:double ;
    dct:description "A restricted morphological similarity is measurable with comparative data. The stronger evolutionary and mechanistic implication is underdetermined by similarity alone." ;
    rdfs:comment "Proposed test with existing data: Compare movement-axis symmetry metrics in Anthrobots with homologous metrics across public images or 3D models of bilaterian locomotors, testing a prespecified similarity threshold." ;
